  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo></math>probability of success and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo></math>probability of failure,&nbsp;</p><p>Now given,</p><p>Sum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mtext>i</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p>Product&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mtext>ii</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p>Also&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;....<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mtext>iii</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p>Solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mtext>i</mtext></mfenced></math>&nbsp;, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mtext>ii</mtext></mfenced></math>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mtext>iii</mtext></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>32</mn></mmultiscripts><mi>p</mi><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>31</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>32</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>30</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>33</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>28</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
